1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,942
A sound wave can be described in two ways.

2
00:00:02,942 --> 00:00:06,601
By how far the air layers are displaced from their resting places.

3
00:00:06,601 --> 00:00:13,815
Or by the excess pressure: how much the pressure rises above, or falls below, the steady atmospheric value.

